      {
        "id": 3912856010,
        "type": null,
        "body": "Merged into `master` as merge commit b7152a7d9 (merge method, no squash or rebase needed: one commit, no conflicts, and master's intervening help-sync changes touched disjoint files). The merged tree equals the reviewed head 6c7ff1223 plus those help-sync changes.\n\nWhat landed:\n\n- `run_legacy_table_migrations()` in `src/database/db_init.c`, run from `startup_database_init()` after the required migrations. Versioned, idempotent migrations:\n  - 2026092701: `weather_cache.wind_speed` (replaces the dead ALTER in the create path)\n  - 2026092702: `player_save_objs.idx_name`\n  - 2026092703: `hint_usage_log` room-keyed columns, with the old `region_vnum` made nullable\n- A failure logs a SYSERR and retries at the next boot instead of stopping the server.\n- `Test_legacy_table_migrations_repair_old_shapes_idempotently` in `unittests/CuTest/test_database_persistence.c`, and the updated `docs/systems/DATABASE_INTEGRATION.md`.\n\nFollow-up: none required. Dev and production schemas were already repaired; production runs this code at its next release, where the migrations no-op against the repaired tables. No work item tracked this change.",
